[31m+ // and run a JS-side envelope follower that writes `target.gain` via[39m
[31m+ // `setTargetAtTime`. This works in both realtime and offline contexts; the[39m
[31m+ // analysis is main-thread, not audio-rate, so ducking granularity is bounded[39m
[31m+ // by the JS timer — fine for musical sidechain but not for sub-10 ms precision.[39m
