[31m+[39m
[31m+ /**[39m
[31m+  * Ozvena's editor uses dotted paths into its canonical state tree. Keep the[39m
[31m+  * key catalog next to the default state so A/B snapshots and project loads[39m
[31m+  * can reject stale/corrupt paths before they reach the AudioWorklet.[39m
